{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "149", "x": 0.8953504215774838, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03839282702615196, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Friend): Yes, that's it. I've only been there a couple of times, but I was", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12319506908974809, "w": 0.8261460008655157, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "really impressed. The chef used to work at Don Filipes, apparently. I was really", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15152541916388573, "w": 0.8260553688063522, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "sorry when that closed down.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.17970752416545568, "w": 0.3074905602711908, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Woman): So, is all the food they serve Spanish, then?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2080378742395933, "w": 0.6573024218547113, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Friend): Yeah, you can get lots of small dishes to share, which always", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.23636822431373095, "w": 0.826080692469942, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "works really well if you're in a group.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.26469857438786853, "w": 0.38187072259484917, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Woman): Worth thinking about.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2930660423122369, "w": 0.44177128569265295, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Friend): Yeah, there's a lively atmosphere and the waiters are really", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.32139637352567824, "w": 0.826679540725116, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "friendly. The only thing is that you need to pay a £50 deposit to book a table.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3497267990426009, "w": 0.7850992128851721, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Woman): A lot of restaurants are doing that these days. I should have", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3780571491167385, "w": 0.8260117957009852, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "a look at the menu to check there's a good choice of vegetarian dishes. A couple", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.40638753691226864, "w": 0.8268634704922417, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "of my friends have stopped eating meat.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4347178869864063, "w": 0.4183889321031569, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Friend): Not sure. I'd say the selection of those would be quite limited.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4630482747819364, "w": 0.8323007788923266, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Friend): I've just thought of another idea. Have you been to the Orley?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.49140337008956114, "w": 0.8323007788923266, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Woman): No, don't think I've heard of it. How's it spelled?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5197337201636988, "w": 0.7030593600002789, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Friend): A U D L E Y. You must have heard of it. There's been a lot about", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5480641079592289, "w": 0.8261919320448202, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "it in the press.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5763944580333665, "w": 0.15283423058046655, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Woman): I don't tend to pay much attention to that kind of thing. So,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6047248458288966, "w": 0.8260797697453578, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "where is it? Exactly.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6330551959030343, "w": 0.21275158213945589, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Friend): It's in that hotel near Baxter Bridge on the top floor.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6612743433120499, "w": 0.7385360697653603, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Woman): Oh, the views would be incredible from up there.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6896046933861876, "w": 0.710114358383973, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Friend): Yeah, I'd love to go. I can't think of the chef's name, but she", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7179351189031102, "w": 0.826225150129853, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "was a judge on that TV cookery show recently, and she's written a couple of", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7462654689772478, "w": 0.8264817700892264, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "cookery books.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7745958190513854, "w": 0.16331599738889446, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Woman): Oh, Angela Fra.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8029261691255231, "w": 0.37743615950545245, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Friend): That's the one. Anyway, it's had excellent reviews from all the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8312565191996607, "w": 0.8264266116640795, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "newspapers. Speaker 1 (Woman): that would be a memorable place for a", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8596116899500704, "w": 0.8261641477823392, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "celebration.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8879420400242081, "w": 0.1312660047860699, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}